{"id":"7bd6cfe0ea1aa0a0","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-ample-bundle.md","title":"Ample Line Bundle","display":"df-ample-bundle — Ample Line Bundle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ample-bundle","aliases":["58-df-ample-bundle"],"display":"df-ample-bundle — Ample Line Bundle","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ample-bundle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ample-bundle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ample-bundle — Ample Line Bundle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eaa26a086cb6c5af\" href=\"?note=eaa26a086cb6c5af\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md\">../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k\\in V\">\\(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k\\in V\\)</span> (line-bundle data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S\\)</span> (line-bundle predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eaa26a086cb6c5af\" href=\"?note=eaa26a086cb6c5af\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md\">../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompleteLinearSystemMap}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{CompleteLinearSystemMap}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClosedImmersion}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ClosedImmersion}_S\\)</span> (algebro-geometric predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AmpleLineBundle}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{AmpleLineBundle}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ample\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AmpleLineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{CompleteLinearSystemMap}_S(\\varphi,L^{\\otimes n},X,\\mathbb P_k^N)\n\\land\\operatorname{ClosedImmersion}_S(\\varphi,X,\\mathbb P_k^N)\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ample\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AmpleLineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{CompleteLinearSystemMap}_S(\\varphi,L^{\\otimes n},X,\\mathbb P_k^N)\n\\land\\operatorname{ClosedImmersion}_S(\\varphi,X,\\mathbb P_k^N)\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nakai–Moishezon criterion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> ample <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff\">\\(\\iff\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_Y L^{\\dim Y} &gt; 0\">\\(\\int_Y L^{\\dim Y} &gt; 0\\)</span> for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Kleiman's criterion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> ample <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff\">\\(\\iff\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is numerically effective and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^{\\dim X} &gt; 0\">\\(L^{\\dim X} &gt; 0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Serre's criterion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> ample <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff\">\\(\\iff\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists m: H^i(X, L^m) = 0\">\\(\\exists m: H^i(X, L^m) = 0\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i &gt; 0\">\\(i &gt; 0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>这里把“某个正张量幂非常丰富”展开为该幂的完整线性系给出闭嵌入。</li>\n<li>此处的闭浸入是代数几何概念；不再错误复用模型论结构的 <code>Embedding_S</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"eaa26a086cb6c5af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"eaa26a086cb6c5af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S$ (line-bundle predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompleteLinearSystemMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClosedImmersion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AmpleLineBundle}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ample\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AmpleLineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{CompleteLinearSystemMap}_S(\\varphi,L^{\\otimes n},X,\\mathbb P_k^N)\n\\land\\operatorname{ClosedImmersion}_S(\\varphi,X,\\mathbb P_k^N)\\bigr)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\iff","display":false},{"tex":"\\int_Y L^{\\dim Y} > 0","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\iff","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L^{\\dim X} > 0","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\iff","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists m: H^i(X, L^m) = 0","display":false},{"tex":"i > 0","display":false}],"bytes":1518,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ample-bundle.md|58-df-ample-bundle]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["eaa26a086cb6c5af"]}